Modified copies
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Buildat carries changed copies of some of the above, and says so where the
copy lives: 3rdparty/Urho3D/Urho3D_version.txt lists what was stripped from
Urho3D 1.7.1 and what was changed in it, and
3rdparty/polyvox/polyvox_version.txt does the same for PolyVox. The vendored
Luanti tree is unmodified; if a file in it is ever changed, it says so at the
top of itself.


